    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Darkblade</strong>, <strong>Fury</strong>, or <strong>Weaponmaster</strong>.</p><hr><p>After you hit a creature with @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.skills.Item.WZDdQfw9VF64La2P]{Breach}, if you attacked with a <strong>melee weapon</strong> that belongs to the <strong>heavy</strong> Category, you may have the attack deal damage equal to your <strong>High Roll</strong> instead of dealing no damage. Any source of extra damage, including the extra damage from the third option of the <strong>Breach</strong> Skill itself, still applies — ignore the bonus to damage granted by the <strong>weapon</strong>.</p>",
